  <language>fr_FR</language>
  <keyword>echarts.chart</keyword>
  <short_description>graphique ECharts oriente objet.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>c = echarts.chart(type)</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <param_input>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>type</param_name>
      <param_description>le type de serie ECharts principal ('bar','line','scatter','pie', ...).</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
  </param_input>
  <param_output>
    <param_output_item>
      <param_name>c</param_name>
      <param_description>un objet echarts.chart.</param_description>
    </param_output_item>
  </param_output>
  <description>
    <p>Cree un graphique vide que l'on remplit avec les methodes fluides (addSeries, title, legend, option, ...). Utiliser les fabriques typees (echarts.bar, echarts.line, ...) pour les cas courants, ou echarts.fromOption pour une option prete.</p>
  </description>
  <used_function />
  <bibliography>https://echarts.apache.org/en/option.html</bibliography>
  <examples>
    <example_item>
      <example_item_type>nelson</example_item_type>
      <example_item_description />
      <example_item_data><![CDATA[c = echarts.chart('line');
c.labels({'a','b','c'});
c.addSeries([1 3 2], 'name', 'x');
c.show();]]></example_item_data>
      <example_item_img src="../../images/echarts_chart.png" align="middle" />
    </example_item>
  </examples>
